==============================================================

                                      iBeacon
  Total   AD 1   Ad     Apple Inc     Prefix        .  . 
  Length  Len    Type   ---------     ---------     -----
   |      |      |      |       |     |       |     |
   1d     19     ff     4c     00     02     15     56

